docs {
  # nutri-calc API

  1. Start the server: `bin/rails s`
  2. Pick the **local** environment (top right).
  3. Run **Register** first. It makes up a new email and nickname each time and logs you in.
     The other requests reuse that email and the login cookie.

  Or run the whole collection in order with **Run** on the collection.

  These requests write to your development database.
}
